      "index": 4,
      "className": "csp-story",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A remittance app growing in the UK, Ireland and the Gulf that needed installs from Bangladeshi and South Asian communities at a sustainable cost."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The previous campaigns targeted whole countries with English creative. Cost per install was high and most installs never made a first transfer."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Audiences rebuilt around language, community pages and payday timing",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Creative in Bangla, Hindi and Urdu, with real exchange rates in the ad",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "YouTube campaigns around cricket and Eid, when transfers spike",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Install tracking tied to first transfer, so the campaigns optimised for real customers",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Weekly creative testing: 90 ads, 11 winners",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "48,000 installs in five months at 52% lower cost, with first-transfer rate up from 23% to 41%."
        }
      ]
    },
